ent-AutosurgeonSandevistanTSF = TSF autosurgeon (WJY-21X sandevistan)
    .desc = Replaces the heart with a reverse-engineered MMC Sandevistan. Doesn't cool down as fast as the real thing.
ent-AutosurgeonSandevistanTSFFlatpack = TSF autosurgeon (WJY-21X sandevistan) flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a TSF autosurgeon.
ent-AutosurgeonShuntTSF = TSF autosurgeon (KR-22 shunt device)
    .desc = Replaces the heart with a highly experimental shunt device. Thats some scary tech.
