    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a TSF autosurgeon.
ent-AutosurgeonIASPDV = PDV autosurgeon (LS-210 IAS)
    .desc = Replaces the lungs with an advanced internal-air-system. Capable of filtering out most atmos gases and increasing respiratory efficiency greatly.
ent-AutosurgeonIASPDVFlatpack = PDV autosurgeon (LS-210 IAS) flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a PDV autosurgeon.
ent-AutosurgeonDermalArmorPDV = PDV autosurgeon (E-SAPI dermal armor)
    .desc = Implants an array of E-SAPI armor plates into the body. Makes you more vulnerable to heat and shock, but makes you more resistant to bullets.
ent-AutosurgeonDermalArmorPDVFlatpack = PDV autosurgeon (E-SAPI dermal armor) flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a PDV autosurgeon.
ent-AutosurgeonAdvHeartPDV = PDV autosurgeon (VV/KE prosthetic heart)
    .desc = Replaces the heart with a more powerful one. Lets you process reagents faster and take more damage before going down, but lowers your stamina and processes medicine slower.
